 *   <li>Creating directories with {@link Files#createDirectories(Path)} and re‑validating the
 *       resulting canonical path.</li>
 *   <li>Writing file data via {@link Files#newOutputStream(Path, java.nio.file.OpenOption...)}.
 * </ul>
 *
 * The method works with Java 7 and does not rely on external libraries for path sanitisation.
